{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T09:38:16.683Z","ordinal":4478,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0612ff0593abfece016aa66ee7baf487d29e1a55e10529c511","status":"completed","call_id":"call_185lFFTfcJJcU4LKePhQgYZa","name":"exec","input":"const p='/var/folders/j4/4j7qn2vd4zd6ykklypxn1d540000gn/T/perigee-results.9Xj5K0Y1zD/tmp/';\nconst prev='/var/folders/j4/4j7qn2vd4zd6ykklypxn1d540000gn/T/perigee-fixed.CQ94rPIxQ4/tmp/';\nlet plan=(await tools.exec_command({cmd:`cat ${prev}plan.mjs`,max_output_tokens:4000})).output;\nplan=plan.replaceAll('pending model status','retrained model result').replaceAll('Fine-tuned models await retraining.','Retrained SP model75.89 P.837 R.643 F1.727; TN98 FP14 FN40 TP72.').replaceAll('Update fixed-split baselines','Update fixed-split results');\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(`*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: ${p}plan.mjs\\n+${plan.trimEnd().split('\\n').join('\\n+')}\\n*** End Patch`));\nlet edit=(await tools.exec_command({cmd:`cat ${prev}edit.mjs`,max_output_tokens:6500})).output;\nconst copy={\n'results-title':'OpenTSLM improves on the two-shot LLM.',\n'comparison-scope':'224 test windows · event-grouped · reported accuracy',\n'extrema-count':'50.45%', 'masks-count':'75.89%',\n'extrema-name':'Two-shot Llama-3.2-3B', 'masks-name':'OpenTSLM · retrained',\n'extrema-recall':'Recall 0.9% · precision 1.000', 'masks-recall':'Recall 64.3% · F1 0.727',\n'key-learning':'Classical summary statistics still lead: 90.18% accuracy.',\n'native-pending':'OpenTSLM: 72 positive windows detected · 40 missed · 14 false alarms.\\nClassical, prompt features: F1 0.891 · OpenTSLM precision: 0.837.',\n'evaluation-caveat':'Positive = Anomaly + Rare Event · two-shot precision reflects very few alerts'\n};\nedit=edit.replace(/const copy=.*?;\\n/,`const copy=${JSON.stringify(copy)};\\n`);\nconst notes='Source: current Docs/PITCH_REQUIREMENTS_CHECKLIST.md updated September13 at11:35. Retrained from scratch on H200: OpenTSLM SP with sub-category-balanced sampling, Llama3.2-3B with LoRA. Fixed event-grouped test224 windows,112 nominal and112 positive; all channels of an event grouped by anomaly_id. No split percentages on slide. Reported accuracy75.89% (170/224), P.837 R.643 F1.727. Confusion TN98 FP14 FN40 TP72. Rare Event recall49/74=66.2%; Anomaly recall23/38=60.5%. Checkpoint epoch7 chosen by validation loss.4377. Two-shot frozen LLM50.45% P1 R.009; F1 and new parsing count unreported. Restricted classical mean/std/telecommands90.18%, P1 R.804 F1.891. Five-feature classical92.86%, P1 R.857 F1.923. Raw120-point classical57.59%, P.623 R.384 F1.475. OpenTSLM improves on two-shot but trails summary-statistics logistic regression. This comparison changes training and representations, not an isolated encoder ablation. Event grouping removes reported shared-event leakage but does not make evaluation chronological or flight-validated. Earlier model results superseded for pitch. Mission Control remains older saved workflow replay; no new per-window inference is implied. Generated rationales not validated. Reported checklist results, not independently reproduced here.';\nedit=edit.replace(/s.speakerNotes.textFrame.setText\\(.*\\);/,`s.speakerNotes.textFrame.setText(${JSON.stringify(notes)});`);\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(`*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: ${p}edit.mjs\\n+${edit.trimEnd().split('\\n').join('\\n+')}\\n*** End Patch`));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:`node ${p}plan.mjs\\nnode /Users/luisdehlwes/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/presentations/26.630.12135/skills/presentations/template_following_scripts/prepare_template_starter_deck.mjs --workspace ${p} --pptx outputs/perigee-jury-pitch.pptx --map ${p}template-frame-map.json --out ${p}template-starter.pptx --preview-dir ${p}template-starter-preview --layout-dir ${p}template-starter-layout`,yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"npm run test:unit && npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run build\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/luisdehlwes/Developer/02_events/04_zurich/ehl-zurich-hackathon-submission/web\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":1500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a09a1f-5842-7af1-ac12-7cf624fbc8c9","create_time":1789292258.97454}}}
