{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T09:38:17.304Z","ordinal":4483,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09554-4029-7852-babe-0cbdfd76c3e6","turn_id":"01a09a1f-5842-7af1-ac12-7cf624fbc8c9","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-d3a17e32-be4d-450d-9663-fe6a464c29ae","changes":{"/var/folders/j4/4j7qn2vd4zd6ykklypxn1d540000gn/T/perigee-results.9Xj5K0Y1zD/tmp/edit.mjs":{"type":"add","content":"import fs from 'node:fs/promises';\nimport {createRequire} from 'node:module';\nimport {FileBlob,PresentationFile} from '@oai/artifact-tool';\nconst p=new URL('.',import.meta.url).pathname;\nconst target='/Users/luisdehlwes/Developer/02_events/04_zurich/ehl-zurich-hackathon-submission/outputs/perigee-jury-pitch.pptx';\nconst original=await fs.readFile(target);await fs.writeFile(p+'original.pptx',original,{flag:'wx'}).catch(e=>{if(e.code!=='EEXIST')throw e;});\nconst d=await PresentationFile.importPptx(await FileBlob.load(p+'template-starter.pptx'));const s=d.slides.items[5];\nconst copy={\"results-title\":\"OpenTSLM improves on the two-shot LLM.\",\"comparison-scope\":\"224 test windows · event-grouped · reported accuracy\",\"extrema-count\":\"50.45%\",\"masks-count\":\"75.89%\",\"extrema-name\":\"Two-shot Llama-3.2-3B\",\"masks-name\":\"OpenTSLM · retrained\",\"extrema-recall\":\"Recall 0.9% · precision 1.000\",\"masks-recall\":\"Recall 64.3% · F1 0.727\",\"key-learning\":\"Classical summary statistics still lead: 90.18% accuracy.\",\"native-pending\":\"OpenTSLM: 72 positive windows detected · 40 missed · 14 false alarms.\\nClassical, prompt features: F1 0.891 · OpenTSLM precision: 0.837.\",\"evaluation-caveat\":\"Positive = Anomaly + Rare Event · two-shot precision reflects very few alerts\"};\nfor(const[name,value]of Object.entries(copy)){const o=s.shapes.items.find(x=>x.name===name);if(!o)throw Error(name);o.text=value;}\ns.speakerNotes.textFrame.setText(\"Source: current Docs/PITCH_REQUIREMENTS_CHECKLIST.md updated September13 at11:35. Retrained from scratch on H200: OpenTSLM SP with sub-category-balanced sampling, Llama3.2-3B with LoRA. Fixed event-grouped test224 windows,112 nominal and112 positive; all channels of an event grouped by anomaly_id. No split percentages on slide. Reported accuracy75.89% (170/224), P.837 R.643 F1.727. Confusion TN98 FP14 FN40 TP72. Rare Event recall49/74=66.2%; Anomaly recall23/38=60.5%. Checkpoint epoch7 chosen by validation loss.4377. Two-shot frozen LLM50.45% P1 R.009; F1 and new parsing count unreported. Restricted classical mean/std/telecommands90.18%, P1 R.804 F1.891. Five-feature classical92.86%, P1 R.857 F1.923. Raw120-point classical57.59%, P.623 R.384 F1.475. OpenTSLM improves on two-shot but trails summary-statistics logistic regression. This comparison changes training and representations, not an isolated encoder ablation. Event grouping removes reported shared-event leakage but does not make evaluation chronological or flight-validated. Earlier model results superseded for pitch. Mission Control remains older saved workflow replay; no new per-window inference is implied. Generated rationales not validated. Reported checklist results, not independently reproduced here.\");\n\nawait(await PresentationFile.exportPptx(d)).save(p+'edited-native.pptx');\nconst require=createRequire(import.meta.resolve('@oai/artifact-tool'));const JSZip=require('jszip');const z=await JSZip.loadAsync(original);const gen=await JSZip.loadAsync(await fs.readFile(p+'edited-native.pptx'));\nconst allowed=['ppt/slides/slide6.xml','ppt/slides/_rels/slide6.xml.rels','ppt/notesSlides/notesSlide6.xml','ppt/notesSlides/_rels/notesSlide6.xml.rels'];\nfor(const part of allowed)z.file(part,await gen.file(part).async('nodebuffer'));\nawait fs.writeFile(p+'perigee-jury-pitch.pptx',await z.generateAsync({type:'nodebuffer',compression:'DEFLATE'}));\nconst check=await JSZip.loadAsync(await fs.readFile(p+'perigee-jury-pitch.pptx'),{checkCRC32:true});const old=await JSZip.loadAsync(original);\nfor(const[name,e]of Object.entries(old.files))if(!e.dir&&!allowed.includes(name)&&!(await e.async('nodebuffer')).equals(await check.file(name).async('nodebuffer')))throw Error('Unexpected edit '+name);\nconst f=await PresentationFile.importPptx(await FileBlob.load(p+'perigee-jury-pitch.pptx'));await fs.mkdir(p+'preview',{recursive:true});await fs.mkdir(p+'layout/final',{recursive:true});\nfor(const[i,sl]of f.slides.items.entries()){await fs.writeFile(p+`preview/slide-${i+1}.png`,new Uint8Array(await(await f.export({slide:sl,format:'png',scale:1})).arrayBuffer()));await fs.writeFile(p+`layout/final/slide-${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}.layout.json`,await(await sl.export({format:'layout'})).text());}\nawait fs.writeFile(p+'montage.webp',new Uint8Array(await(await f.export({format:'webp',montage:true,scale:.5})).arrayBuffer()));\nawait fs.writeFile(p+'qa-preservation.txt','Only slide6 footer and notes parts replaced with artifact-tool output. All other source parts byte-identical, including native video, timing, demo screenshot and hyperlink.\\n');\nconsole.log(p+'perigee-jury-pitch.pptx');\n"}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA /var/folders/j4/4j7qn2vd4zd6ykklypxn1d540000gn/T/perigee-results.9Xj5K0Y1zD/tmp/edit.mjs\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1789292297203,"completed_at_ms":1789292297304}}
